<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>556 (Green Tip)</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Jace!</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">Virtuous</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">3LSBODvr96eWDzLPyuc1i4</ttm:item>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:02.130" end="00:03.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(One and Only)</p>
      <p begin="00:02.902" end="00:05.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">He ain't no Blood, he ain't this, he ain't that, he ain't a Mac, too (He ain't a mac too)</p>
      <p begin="00:05.228" end="00:08.298" ttm:agent="v1">Sayin' this and that, *****, it's gon' get you clapped too</p>
      <p begin="00:08.298" end="00:10.366" ttm:agent="v1">I be like, uhhh, *****, uhhh</p>
      <p begin="00:10.366" end="00:11.866" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:11.399" end="00:14.735" ttm:agent="v1">I'm talkin' green tip, 5.56, and a blick too</p>
      <p begin="00:14.735" end="00:17.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Oh, he lack? Blick him, blick him, blick you (Nigga)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.827" end="00:20.918" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we on that shit too, I used to hit licks too</p>
      <p begin="00:20.918" end="00:24.027" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga shot a K at me, okay, but he missed too</p>
      <p begin="00:24.027" end="00:25.847" ttm:agent="v1">He ain't this, he ain't that</p>
      <p begin="00:25.847" end="00:27.400" ttm:agent="v1">He ain't a Blood, he ain't a Mac</p>
      <p begin="00:27.400" end="00:30.505" ttm:agent="v1">He be saying this and that, it's gon' get him clapped too</p>
      <p begin="00:30.505" end="00:33.633" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ridin' with a big Mac, *****, this ain't no fast food (*****)</p>
      <p begin="00:33.633" end="00:37.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just shot a foul ball, it's good because I made the rules (Nigga)</p>
      <p begin="00:37.489" end="00:40.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">That boy sweet as hell, why you think he stayed in school? (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:40.345" end="00:43.461" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I used to bang it out with opps, the police take my tool (*****)</p>
      <p begin="00:43.461" end="00:46.571" ttm:agent="v1">I be like &quot;**** the wannabes&quot;, they be like, &quot;Iayze a fool&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:46.571" end="00:51.013" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">It ain't shit to get her on her knees, all I gotta do is keep it cool (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.013" end="00:52.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ayy, who is he? (Who is he?)</p>
      <p begin="00:52.840" end="00:56.181" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I like green tip, 5.56, my ARPs (Nigga, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:56.181" end="00:59.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I like pouring Tris, ****in' hoes, and throwing C's (*****, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:59.271" end="01:02.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">She love D'usse, shaking ass, and love smoking my weed (*****, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.590" end="01:05.954" ttm:agent="v1">I use to post up on that block, fifty cent for a single, ain't have no weed</p>
      <p begin="01:05.954" end="01:09.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The i8 I'm in, ain't came wit' no keys (Okay, mmmyoom)</p>
      <p begin="01:09.055" end="01:12.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">She want me save a *****, I ain't Christopher Reeves (*****, I ain't no savior, man)</p>
      <p begin="01:12.164" end="01:15.254" ttm:agent="v1">Say she a slut, then she get slut, I get my nut, and then I leave</p>
      <p begin="01:15.254" end="01:18.659" ttm:agent="v1">I'm talkin' green tip, 5.56, and a blick too</p>
      <p begin="01:18.659" end="01:21.736" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Oh, he lack? Blick him, blick him, blick you (Nigga)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.736" end="01:25.102" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we on that shit too, I used to hit licks too</p>
      <p begin="01:25.102" end="01:28.206" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga shot a K at me, okay, but he missed too</p>
      <p begin="01:28.206" end="01:29.706" ttm:agent="v1">He ain't this, he ain't that</p>
      <p begin="01:29.509" end="01:31.297" ttm:agent="v1">He ain't a Blood, he ain't a Mac</p>
      <p begin="01:31.297" end="01:34.897" ttm:agent="v1">He be saying this and that, it's gon' get him clapped too</p>
      <p begin="01:34.897" end="01:37.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ridin' with a big Mac, *****, this ain't no fast food (Huh, okay)</p>
      <p begin="01:37.988" end="01:41.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just shot a foul ball, it's good because I made the rules (Nigga, *****)</p>
      <p begin="01:41.334" end="01:42.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:42.610" end="01:45.692" ttm:agent="v1">Think he stayed in school, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:45.692" end="01:49.522" ttm:agent="v1">Bang it out with opps, the police take my tool, *****</p>
      <p begin="01:49.522" end="01:52.635" ttm:agent="v1">They be like, &quot;Iayze a fool&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:52.635" end="01:55.220" ttm:agent="v1">All I gotta do is keep it cool</p>
      <p begin="01:55.220" end="01:56.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ayy, okay)</p>
      <p begin="01:56.252" end="02:00.252" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Who is he?, who is he?)</p>
    </div>
  </body>
